CREATE FUNCTION saas.accounting_sales_channel_matches_v4(p_store uuid,p_receivable uuid,p_order uuid,p_metadata jsonb,p_channel text) RETURNS boolean LANGUAGE sql STABLE SECURITY DEFINER SET search_path=pg_catalog,saas AS $f$
 SELECT p_channel IS NULL OR EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM saas.in_store_sales s WHERE s.store_id=p_store AND s.sales_channel=p_channel AND (s.accounting_receivable_id=p_receivable OR s.order_id=p_order OR s.id::text=p_metadata->>'saleId')) OR p_channel='manual' AND EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM saas.orders WHERE store_id=p_store AND id=p_order AND source='manual')
$f$;
CREATE FUNCTION saas.accounting_pending_receipt_v4(p_store uuid,p_event uuid) RETURNS boolean LANGUAGE sql STABLE SECURITY DEFINER SET search_path=pg_catalog,saas AS $f$
 SELECT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM saas.in_store_payment_receipts_v4 r JOIN saas.in_store_sales s ON s.store_id=r.store_id AND s.id=r.sale_id WHERE r.store_id=p_store AND r.event_id=p_event AND s.status<>'completed')
$f$;
CREATE FUNCTION saas.accounting_event_sales_channel_matches_v4(p_store uuid,p_event uuid,p_channel text) RETURNS boolean LANGUAGE sql STABLE SECURITY DEFINER SET search_path=pg_catalog,saas AS $f$
 SELECT p_channel IS NULL OR EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM saas.accounting_events e LEFT JOIN saas.accounting_events original ON original.store_id=e.store_id AND original.id=e.reverses_event_id WHERE e.store_id=p_store AND e.id=p_event AND (saas.accounting_sales_channel_matches_v4(p_store,NULL,coalesce(original.order_id,e.order_id),coalesce(original.metadata,e.metadata),p_channel) OR EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM saas.accounting_allocations a JOIN saas.accounting_receivables r ON r.store_id=a.store_id AND r.id=a.receivable_id WHERE a.store_id=p_store AND a.event_id=coalesce(original.id,e.id) AND saas.accounting_sales_channel_matches_v4(p_store,r.id,r.order_id,NULL,p_channel))))
$f$;
